load @term/seed/structure/space/hilbert
  find hilbert-space

# Quantum theory: the physics of the very small, where states are vectors in a Hilbert space, observables are operators,
# and measurement is probabilistic. Superposition, entanglement, and the uncertainty principle are its signatures. In
# the substrate the smooth quantum amplitudes are emergent, the coarse-grained statistics of the discrete underlying
# tones. The form carries the Hilbert space of states.
form quantum-theory
  link states, like hilbert-space
